 "subject": "Driver character: seated driver in every car, thrown out on crashes",
 "body": "- Driver.tscn (AnimatedSprite2D): idle/driving/accelerating/braking/jumping/scared/\n  crashing/recovering from the car's speed, input, air time and tilt; switches only on change\n- EjectedDriver.tscn (RigidBody2D, own layer): spawned once at crash with the seat's velocity\n  (incl. spin) + impulse, tumbles, lands with the dizzy frames; freed with the car\n- DriverConfig resource (purple_driver.tres) for future characters\n- seats.json: each car's driver window / open seat; driver clipped to the window\n- car.make_ejection_data / eject_driver / driver_ejected: one ejection record, ready to be\n  sent by a server later; replays show the thrown driver\n- tools/import_driver.py cuts the sprite sheet and writes the SpriteFrames\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
